From 3b5516f8cea87a0ed8b8337984fa29b09837658d Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Markus Boehme <markus.boehme@chainguard.dev>
Date: Tue, 9 Dec 2025 21:23:26 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 1/5] vendor: vendor github.com/pjbgf/sha1cd as crypto/sha1
 alternative

Vendor github.com/pjbgf/sha1cd as a crypto/sha1 alternative. sha1cd is
a SHA1 implementation based on crypto/sha1, but able to detect collision
attacks on SHA1 hashes. It can be used for purposes that are not
security relevant without having to import crypto/sha1.

Signed-off-by: Markus Boehme <markus.boehme@chainguard.dev>
